(A) Your FULL NAMES
(B) ADDRESS DETAILS,PLEASE NO P.O BOXES
(C) HOME AND WORK PHONE NUMBERS (INCLUDING CELL PHONE NUMBER)
(D) AGREEMENT AND ACCEPTANCE OF THIS REQUEST.
 
       Once I get these details I will forward them from time to time to my clients who will then issue out the payments in your favour and send it to you for cashing.
       This is a completely legal thing in as much as you prove your honesty by acting to instructions,people have made away with my monies in the past and i am trying to be carfeful this time around. You can cash the check wherever you choose,i know they charge commission at the cashing facilities,it's okay if you go cash them there.
 
